        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88TB18, 88 Solid Brass 18\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana 88TB18 towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. The 18\" length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass, it is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. This 88 series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88TB18-specifications.gif?v=1704354725\" width=\"600\" height=\"177\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88TB18 18\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-88-series-towel-bar-deltana-88tb12\"><b>12\" 88 Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-88-series-towel-bar-deltana-88tb24\"><b>24\" 88 Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass 18 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 19-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88TB18.pdf?v=1691095382\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88TB18 18\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
